  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 31/03/2025, the proposal as shown on the drawings submitted on 31/03/2025 and numbered 'K250304/P01, K250304/P02, K250304/P03, K250304/P04, K250304/P05, K250304/P06' was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E Clauses (e) and (f) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, the proposed structure, together with the existing raised platform upon which the structure would be situated would result in the height of the development exceeding that set out in (e) and (f) referenced above.   \r\n"
